- [Beyond the warehouse: How METRO Markets built a do-it-all data platform on ClickHouse Cloud](https://clickhouse.com/blog/metro-markets-data-warehouse): How METRO Markets replaced a failing Hadoop-based stack with ClickHouse Cloud to build a single platform now powering data warehousing, real-time seller analytics, credit risk modeling, observability, and AI across the whole company.
- [Why everyone is talking about real-time analytics (a note from “the yellow company”)](https://clickhouse.com/blog/why-everyone-is-talking-about-real-analytics-yellow-company): For years, real-time analytics was treated as a niche requirement. We believed otherwise. So why is everyone talking about it now?
- [Appcues delivers personalized customer engagement with ClickHouse Cloud](https://clickhouse.com/blog/appcues-customer-engagement-analytics): Appcues cut P95 query times 90%, ingestion latency 99%, and analytics spend 23% by migrating from Snowflake and Airflow to ClickHouse Cloud for real-time segmentation across 1.31 PB of data.
